1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,890
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:08,020
=Episode 26=

5
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:17,199
So,

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,719
you're upset he kept it from you?

7
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,000
I don't know.

8
00:00:27,359 --> 00:00:28,920
It's just that suddenly...

9
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,399
I thought

10
00:00:32,359 --> 00:00:34,640
we started with a contract.

11
00:00:36,159 --> 00:00:37,520
But it seems

12
00:00:38,479 --> 00:00:41,079
he's been in my life for so long.

13
00:00:45,479 --> 00:00:47,560
I'm scared he loves me

14
00:00:49,039 --> 00:00:50,079
more than I can handle.

15
00:00:51,679 --> 00:00:52,240
Hua,

16
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,520
love doesn't feel heavy

17
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,280
just because it's lasted a long time.

18
00:00:58,439 --> 00:00:59,359
It feels heavy

19
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,560
when it leaves you no room to breathe.

20
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,000
Mr. Xie treats you well,

21
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:05,840
but

22
00:01:06,159 --> 00:01:07,719
he doesn't make your choices for you.

23
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:09,439
You wanted to move out,

24
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:10,680
so he let you.

25
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,079
When you're in trouble,

26
00:01:13,359 --> 00:01:14,799
he's the first to stand up for you.

27
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,359
And in the end,

28
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,760
he still respects your choices.

29
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,760
That kind of love

30
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,640
doesn't trap you.

31
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,000
It protects you.

32
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:27,760
That said,

33
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:28,959
with men,

34
00:01:29,079 --> 00:01:30,799
sometimes you have to make them wait.

35
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:32,640
Especially the ones

36
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,359
with too much money

37
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:36,040
who never know what to say.

38
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,159
They get better if you let them stew.

39
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:40,799
Good point.

40
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,319
Thanks, Bei Ruo.

41
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:51,760
You never have to thank me.

42
00:01:53,519 --> 00:01:54,200
But

43
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:57,200
the final review is tomorrow.

44
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,359
Don't let a man

45
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,400
get in the way of work,

46
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:01,920
right?

47
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,599
So when it comes to love,

48
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,840
take your time.

49
00:02:06,079 --> 00:02:08,680
But this project has to work.

50
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:09,960
You're right.

51
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:12,919
Let's nail this project first.

52
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:13,520
Exactly.

53
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,400
This revised proposal

54
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,360
builds on our breathing concept.

55
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:26,639
We've added
three public stopping points.

56
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,759
It's not just a commercial space.

57
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,479
It's a place in the city

58
00:02:30,639 --> 00:02:32,599
where people can pause for a moment.

59
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:33,599
We...

60
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,000
Ms. Xie,

61
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,639
I think we should stop the review.

62
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:45,240
Why?

63
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,840
Lin Hua is suspected of plagiarism

64
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,080
and leaking confidential project files.

65
00:02:59,120 --> 00:02:59,680
Mr. Zhao,

66
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,560
you'll need proof to back that up.

67
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,400
These plans were leaked an hour ago

68
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,240
from inside Lingyu Group.

69
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:11,560
Take a look.

70
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:13,599
The structure,

71
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:14,719
the circulation,

72
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:15,840
and the concept

73
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,120
are almost identical to Lin Hua's.

74
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,800
They really are.

75
00:03:25,319 --> 00:03:26,639
How can they be so similar?

76
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:28,919
Did she really leak them?

77
00:03:32,599 --> 00:03:33,400
Ms. Lin,

78
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,479
care to explain?

79
00:03:39,719 --> 00:03:40,599
I didn't plagiarize,

80
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,479
and I never leaked any project files.

81
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:44,560
If that's what you're claiming,

82
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,240
I'll cooperate with an open inquiry.

83
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:47,879
Check the timeline,

84
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,039
the file records,

85
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:50,879
and everyone who had
access to the files.

86
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:52,719
Are you sure?

87
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:53,879
Absolutely.

88
00:03:59,080 --> 00:03:59,520
Ms. Xie,

89
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:02,639
may we postpone the review
by half a day?

90
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:04,360
By three this afternoon,

91
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,280
I'll have an answer for everyone.

92
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:09,360
All right.

93
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:25,720
Hua,

94
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:26,959
are you okay?

95
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:30,879
I'm fine.

96
00:04:31,199 --> 00:04:32,920
Zhao Song's clearly targeting you.

97
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,240
I know you never leaked those files.

98
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,839
You've heard already?

99
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:46,519
If it involves you,

100
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:48,160
I'm the first to know.

101
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,279
I can help.

102
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:53,920
Xie Zhouhan,

103
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,759
please stay out of this one.

104
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:57,600
If you fix it for me,

105
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,279
everyone will think

106
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,360
when I get into trouble,

107
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,879
someone else has to fix it.

108
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,959
I want to prove myself.

109
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:05,759
Whatever goes wrong,

110
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,079
I can handle it myself.

111
00:05:11,279 --> 00:05:11,800
I understand.

112
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,360
Do you really?

113
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:15,519
Hua,

114
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:18,680
♪I let you keep your stubborn pride♪

115
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,360
I won't interfere.

116
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:21,560
♪I just keep a way back open for you♪

117
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:22,680
But I want you to know,

118
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,800
if you look back...

119
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,800
♪And smile at how beautiful you are♪

120
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,839
I'm always right behind you.

121
00:05:27,839 --> 00:05:30,900
♪I'm right behind you♪

122
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:34,100
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

123
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:37,033
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

124
00:05:37,033 --> 00:05:40,660
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

125
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:44,060
♪I'm right behind you♪

126
00:05:44,060 --> 00:05:47,220
♪I won't make you turn around♪

127
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:49,820
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

128
00:05:49,820 --> 00:05:53,820
♪My love for you is out of control♪

129
00:05:55,873 --> 00:05:58,900
♪You say you don't need anyone♪

130
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:00,000
♪You're just fine♪

131
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,020
♪on your own♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

132
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:05,380
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

133
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:08,220
♪And the pain you face at night♪

134
00:06:09,233 --> 00:06:12,180
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

135
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:15,300
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

136
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:18,380
♪Some love needs no promises♪

137
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:21,460
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

138
00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:24,580
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

139
00:06:24,580 --> 00:06:27,500
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

140
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:30,660
♪I'm right behind you♪

141
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:34,020
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

142
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:36,980
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

143
00:06:36,980 --> 00:06:40,580
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

144
00:06:41,183 --> 00:06:43,980
♪I'm right behind you♪

145
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:47,420
♪I won't make you turn around♪

146
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:50,100
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

147
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:54,220
♪My love for you is out of control♪

148
00:06:54,940 --> 00:06:57,900
♪If the whole world makes you retreat♪

149
00:06:57,900 --> 00:07:01,260
♪I'll leave a window open for you♪

150
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:04,420
♪You don't have to bow to anyone♪

151
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:07,740
♪I'll help you take it all back♪

152
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:09,700
♪If you're tired♪

153
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:11,100
♪Just turn around♪

154
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:14,340
♪I've never left your side♪
